        <mxCell id="leg" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Actors&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Admin&lt;/b&gt; — user management + all employee functions (in the code the &quot;admin gate&quot; is broken: it tests for literal names that do not exist in the data).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Employee / Pharmacist&lt;/b&gt; — day-to-day inventory, purchasing, sales, warnings, messaging.&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• 15 use cases recovered from 27 frames.&#xa;• &lt;b&gt;Navigate Dashboard&lt;/b&gt; (orange) is the hub through which every other use case is reached.&#xa;• Recording a purchase &lt;i&gt;includes&lt;/i&gt; company data (the only real FK link).&#xa;• Authentication is by ID + plain-text password; no session/RBAC enforced." vertex="1">
